3. Root cause

The initial 15b audit used searches that were too literal. They matched
`\omega_0` but not the TeX-equivalent spelling `\omega _0`, because whitespace
separated the control word from the subscript token. The earlier assertion of
complete removal was therefore inaccurate. Stage 15b_1 explicitly corrects
that record in the 15b log.

